<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><title>⚠️ KhetiSetu: Account Temporarily Secured</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#ece8df;font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#ece8df;padding:24px 0;">
  <tr><td align="center">
    <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:600px;width:100%;background-color:#fdf9f0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
      {{> header}}
      <tr><td style="background-color:#fdecea;padding:24px 32px;border-bottom:3px solid #ba1a1a;">
        <h1 style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#ba1a1a;margin:0 0 8px 0;">⚠️ Account Temporarily Locked</h1>
        <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#3a3a3a;margin:0;">Multiple failed login attempts have been detected on your account.</p>
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:28px 32px;">
        <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#3a3a3a;margin:0 0 16px 0;line-height:1.7;">
          Hello {{name}}, we have temporarily locked your KhetiSetu account after <strong>5 consecutive failed login attempts</strong>.
        </p>

        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f7f3ea;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:20px;">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:16px;width:50%;vertical-align:top;">
              <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#5a5a5a;margin:0 0 4px 0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;">Lock Duration</p>
              <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#ba1a1a;margin:0;">15 Minutes</p>
            </td>
            <td style="padding:16px;width:50%;vertical-align:top;border-left:1px solid #e8e4da;">
              <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#5a5a5a;margin:0 0 4px 0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;">Failed Attempts</p>
              <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#08241a;margin:0;">{{failedAttempts}} / 5</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#3a3a3a;margin:0 0 16px 0;line-height:1.7;">
          Your account will be automatically unlocked after 15 minutes. Alternatively, you can reset your password to regain access immediately:
        </p>

        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
          <tr><td align="center" style="padding:8px 0 24px 0;">
            <a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#08241a;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;">Reset Password to Unlock</a>
          </td></tr>
        </table>

        <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#8a8a8a;margin:0;line-height:1.6;border-top:1px solid #e8e4da;padding-top:16px;">
          If this was not you, your account may be under attack. Contact us immediately at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color:#08241a;">{{supportEmail}}</a>
        </p>
      </td></tr>
      {{> footer}}
    </table>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
